SUMMARY:ProSiteGuide: daily growth tasks (Quora\, Facebook\, LinkedIn)
DESCRIPTION:Daily ProSiteGuide growth (30 min)\n1. Quora: answer 1 question (link in every other answer\, add 'Disclosure: it's my site'). Need a draft? Ask Claude: 'Quora answer'.\n2. Facebook group: 1 post from social/facebook-group-posts.md\, reply to every comment in the first hour.\n3. LinkedIn: comment on 5 posts\, send 10 connection requests (no pitch).\n4. Reddit (2-3x a week): answer 1-2 fresh questions\, link only where allowed.\n5. Pinterest (2-3x a week): pin 1 image.\nFacebook Page: https://www.facebook.com/prositeguide/
